<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2473 ;
    djr:text "| 작은/단순 트리, 빈번한 갱신 | Adjacency List |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2474 ;
    djr:text "| 깊은 계층, 복잡한 조상/자손 쿼리 | Closure Table |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2475 ;
    djr:text "| 읽기 중심, 안정적 트리 | Nested Set |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2476 ;
    djr:text "| 단순 트리, 보통 수준 갱신 | Materialized Path |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s061-12.4/b7> a djr:Block ;
