<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s066-13.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.4 다형적 연관 (Polymorphic Associations)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s066-13.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s066-13.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n하나의 자식 엔티티가 여러 부모 타입과 관계를 맺는 패턴.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s066-13.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s066-13.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```sql\nCREATE TABLE comments (\n    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,\n    body TEXT,\n    commentable_type VARCHAR(50),  -- 'Article', 'Video', 'Photo'\n    commentable_id INTEGER         -- 해당 타입의 PK\n);\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s066-13.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s066-13.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2477 ;
    djr:text "**한계**: DB 레벨에서 FK 제약을 강제할 수 없다. 참조 무결성은 애플리케이션 레벨에서 보장해야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5> a djr:Section ;
