    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "|------|----------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2478 ;
    djr:text "| 타입 간 속성 대부분 공유 | STI (단순, JOIN 없음) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2479 ;
    djr:text "| 타입별 속성이 크게 다름, 데이터 무결성 중요 | CTI (정규화, FK 제약) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2480 ;
    djr:text "| 타입이 완전 독립, 접근 패턴 다름 | TPC (성능 우선) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2481 ;
    djr:text "| 여러 부모 타입에 댓글/태그 연결 | Polymorphic Association |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s067-13.5/b7> a djr:Block ;
