    djr:text "> 출처: Martin Fowler, [Single Table Inheritance](https://martinfowler.com/eaaCatalog/singleTableInheritance.html), [Class Table Inheritance](https://martinfowler.com/eaaCatalog/classTableInheritance.html)\n\n"@ko .

